   required-relation-missing -> {"carrier": "none-in-entry", "nativeCause": "must-be-null", "rule": "A sufficiency verdict about a relation the view does NOT carry an entry for, so an entry can never be its own evidence. It has no entry carrier by construction and takes no cause. Kept admissible rather than refused because nothing in this contract states that a host may not record it, and inventing that refusal is not this correction's to make."}
